+  with index ``N``).
+
+  Args:
+    neighbors: A ``NeighborListMultiImage`` (Sparse or OrderedSparse format).
+
+  Returns:
+    Boolean mask. Shape ``[capacity]``. True indicates a valid edge.
+  """
+  N = len(neighbors.reference_position)
+  return neighbors.idx[0] < N  # [capacity]
+
